# Python bytecode and caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.egg-info/

# Virtual environments
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# Node
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/test-results/

